mjau.bok.titel=Cat Care Book
mjau.bok.intro=Everything these cats can do, and what all of it is for.
mjau.bok.tillbaka=Back
mjau.bok.ger=Grants:
mjau.bok.sekt.katterna=The cats
mjau.bok.sekt.kan=What she can do
mjau.bok.sekt.plaggen=Outfits
mjau.bok.sekt.drakt=Your own cat suit
mjau.bok.sekt.mobler=Furniture
mjau.bok.sekt.achv=Achievements
mjau.bok.katterna.txt=Tame any of them with cod, salmon or a Cat Treat. They are not reskins: each breed is built from its own measurements, and each meows in its own pitch. Feed two of the same breed to get a kitten of that breed - born already yours, and it grows up.
mjau.bok.kan.1=§eRide her.§r Put a saddle on a tame cat, then tap her again. Much faster than walking, with a charged jump like a horse.
mjau.bok.kan.2=§eFish for you.§r A saddled cat standing in water catches cod.
mjau.bok.kan.3=§eCarry for you.§r A cat in a backpack has fifteen slots of her own and picks up what you drop or mine within four blocks. Sneak up beside her to take the load.
mjau.bok.kan.4=§eDig up treasure.§r Backpack cats find string and feathers, and once in a long while a diamond.
mjau.bok.kan.5=§eWarn you.§r A cat at your side bristles when something hostile is closing in - not when it is merely standing there.
mjau.bok.kan.6=§ePull the cart.§r Hitch it and sit IN it, steering like a sled, with a back seat for a friend.
mjau.bok.kan.7=§eLive together.§r Cats groom each other when they stand close, kittens play, and at night the flock gathers on beds and boxes and curls up in a sleeping pile.
mjau.bok.plaggen.txt=Craft them, then tap a tame cat while holding one. Every piece can be worn at the same time as every other, and most of them grant her something.
mjau.bok.drakt.1=Four pieces - hood, vest, trousers and paws - in leather, iron, diamond and netherite. Each grants something on its own: night vision from the hood, resistance from the vest, speed from the trousers, a soft landing from the paws.
mjau.bok.drakt.2=§eThe whole suit is only as strong as its weakest piece.§r Wear all four and you get speed, jumping and more, but the tier of the bonus is decided by the LOWEST piece you wear. Mix leather with netherite and you get the leather bonus.
mjau.bok.drakt.3=With the full suit, cats near you heal - and in netherite they are protected too.
mjau.bok.mobler.txt=Cats seek these out on their own. At night they only look for the ones you can sleep on.
mjau.bok.achv.txt=You have earned %s of %s. %s to go.
mjau.bok.achv.hemliga=Some of them are not listed anywhere, and are not going to be.
